---
description: Providers and plugins adapters guidance
globs:
  - "src/providers/**/*.ts"
  - "plugins/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Adapters
  - Map provider-specific payloads to internal request/response types.
  - Keep provider conditionals localized. Avoid leaking provider-specific flags upstream.
  - Support streaming consistently. Normalize events and tokens across providers.

- Configuration
  - Read provider keys and endpoints from env/config. No hard-codes.
  - Prefer per-request configuration objects over hidden global state.

- Reliability
  - Use retries with backoff for transient errors; avoid retrying on 4xx unless specified.
  - Add timeouts and surface meaningful errors with provider context.

